# Candidate application foundations for Debian 13 (Trixie).
#
# This file is documentation/input for scripts/verify-app-foundations.sh.
# It is intentionally NOT a live-build *.list.chroot file and therefore does
# not install anything into an Edemint image.
#
# Format: package|capability|profile|status
# Status remains "candidate" until architecture, dependency, license, launch
# and installed-size gates in docs/APPLICATIONS_ROADMAP.md have passed.

epiphany-browser|WebKitGTK browser foundation|desktop|candidate
gnome-calendar|Calendar|desktop|candidate
gnome-maps|Maps|desktop|candidate
geary|Mail|desktop|candidate
gnome-text-editor|Noterer text-editor foundation|desktop|candidate
font-manager|Font management|desktop|candidate
system-config-printer|Print control frontend|desktop|candidate
gnome-color-manager|Color control frontend|desktop|candidate
colord|Color management service|desktop|candidate
bubblewrap|Inspector process sandbox|core|candidate
xdg-dbus-proxy|Inspector D-Bus boundary|core|candidate
cheese|Standard camera foundation|desktop|candidate
webcamoid|Optional Camera Studio foundation|optional|candidate
goldendict-ng|Dictionary foundation|desktop|candidate
python3|Edemint native app runtime|core|candidate
python3-gi|GObject bindings for native apps|core|candidate
gir1.2-gtk-4.0|GTK4 introspection for native apps|core|candidate
gir1.2-adw-1|libadwaita introspection for native apps|core|candidate
gir1.2-webkit-6.0|WebKitGTK introspection for Adventurer|desktop|candidate
fractal|Messenger foundation|desktop|candidate
gnome-contacts|Contacts foundation and interoperability|desktop|candidate
